      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The pueblo dates to around 1200 AD, placing its founding in the Pueblo III Era of ancestral New Mexico.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ohkay_Owingeh%2C_New_Mexico",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic core of Ohkay Owingeh features flat‑roofed adobe homes and ceremonial kivas that have been built from local soil for generations.",
